        "created_at": "2021-11-06T22:05:39.375Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey, do y’all remember way back in the <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Podcasts/Episode_13\">Gloomweaver episode of <em>The Letters Page</em></a>, Adam jokingly started singing a little ditty about everyone’s favourite Demon-God at the beginning of the Questions Section? Well, I thought that it’s a shame that that little snippet of song was never made into something more, so I decided to do just that. Below is my extended version of that Gloomweaver song.</p>\n<p><strong>Disclaimer: I am definitely no kind of musically-talented person, and I have no professional experience with music. I cannot guarantee that this will meet any minimum level of quality, as some of these rhymes are quite forced. I’m just doing this for fun. ; )</strong></p>\n<p>Now, with no further ado . . .</p>\n<p><em>Gloomweaver</em><br>\n<em>He’s a doom-weaver</em></p>\n<p><em>He has a flaming head</em><br>\n<em>And he raises the dead</em></p>\n<p><em>He has a crocodile tail</em><br>\n<em>And of magic he has every detail</em></p>\n<p><em>Gloomweaver</em><br>\n<em>He’s a doom-weaver</em></p>\n<p><em>He’s trapped in the Realm of Discord</em><br>\n<em>If he get’s out he’ll be our overlord</em></p>\n<p><em>He has Joe Diamond’s soul</em><br>\n<em>And a head that looks like a skull</em></p>\n<p><em>Gloomweaver</em><br>\n<em>He’s a doom-weaver</em></p>\n<p><em>He’s the Nightmare Walker</em><br>\n<em>If you meet him, it’s a real shocker</em></p>\n<p><em>He has a nemesis, Nightmist</em><br>\n<em>Who he wants to crush under his fist</em></p>\n<p><em>Gloomweaver</em><br>\n<em>He’s a doom-weaver</em></p>\n<p><em>He’s tryin’ to enter reality</em><br>\n<em>And if he does, it’ll be a real calamity</em></p>\n<p><em>He’s a Demon-God Incarnate</em><br>\n<em>And we’ll all be dead, at this rate</em></p>\n<p><em>Gloomweaver</em><br>\n<em>He’s a doom-weaver</em></p>\n<p><em>He resurrected Spite</em><br>\n<em>But that didn’t turn out quite right</em></p>\n<p><em>He was a Skinwalker</em><br>\n<em>And he’s quite the talker</em></p>\n<p><em>Gloomweaver</em><br>\n<em>He’s a doom-weaver</em></p>\n<p><em>He became a Rotting God</em><br>\n<em>To that, Lifeline said, “Oh, sod.”</em></p>\n<p><em>He leads that Cult of Gloom</em><br>\n<em>They’re all tryin’ to usher in our doom</em></p>\n<p><em>Gloomweaver</em><br>\n<em>He’s a doom-weaver</em></p>\n<p><em>He’s got the Drum of Despair</em><br>\n<em>In the Realm of Discord, he sits in his chair</em></p>\n<p><em>He has a Grimoire of Curses</em><br>\n<em>Ya see, he’s got magic from so many sources</em></p>\n<p><em>Gloomweaver</em><br>\n<em>He’s a doom-weaver</em></p>\n<p><em>He has a Pouch of Bones</em><br>\n<em>He causes screams of so many tones</em></p>\n<p><em>His Cursed Acolyte, some say</em><br>\n<em>Is a man called Ronway</em></p>\n<p><em>Gloomweaver</em><br>\n<em>He’s a doom-weaver</em></p>\n<p><em>He has a familiar</em><br>\n<em>Ophidia the Deceiver</em></p>\n<p><em>He can do magic through a Voodoo Pin</em><br>\n<em>You Heroes better make sure that he doesn’t win</em></p>\n<p><em>'Cause . . . he’s . . . <strong>GLOOMWEAVER!</strong></em></p>",
