        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Hey, do y'all remember way back in the [Gloomweaver episode of *The Letters Page*](https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Podcasts/Episode_13), Adam jokingly started singing a little ditty about everyone's favourite Demon-God at the beginning of the Questions Section? Well, I thought that it's a shame that that little snippet of song was never made into something more, so I decided to do just that. Below is my extended version of that Gloomweaver song.\n\n**Disclaimer: I am definitely no kind of musically-talented person, and I have no professional experience with music. I cannot guarantee that this will meet any minimum level of quality, as some of these rhymes are quite forced. I'm just doing this for fun. ; )**\n\nNow, with no further ado . . . \n\n*Gloomweaver*\n*He's a doom-weaver*\n\n*He has a flaming head*\n*And he raises the dead*\n\n*He has a crocodile tail*\n*And of magic he has every detail*\n\n*Gloomweaver*\n*He's a doom-weaver*\n\n*He's trapped in the Realm of Discord*\n*If he get's out he'll be our overlord*\n\n*He has Joe Diamond's soul*\n*And a head that looks like a skull*\n\n*Gloomweaver*\n*He's a doom-weaver*\n\n*He's the Nightmare Walker*\n*If you meet him, it's a real shocker*\n\n*He has a nemesis, Nightmist*\n*Who he wants to crush under his fist*\n\n*Gloomweaver*\n*He's a doom-weaver*\n\n*He's tryin' to enter reality*\n*And if he does, it'll be a real calamity*\n\n*He's a Demon-God Incarnate*\n*And we'll all be dead, at this rate*\n\n*Gloomweaver*\n*He's a doom-weaver*\n\n*He resurrected Spite*\n*But that didn't turn out quite right*\n\n*He was a Skinwalker*\n*And he's quite the talker*\n\n*Gloomweaver*\n*He's a doom-weaver*\n\n*He became a Rotting God*\n*To that, Lifeline said, \"Oh, sod.\"*\n\n*He leads that Cult of Gloom*\n*They're all tryin' to usher in our doom*\n\n*Gloomweaver*\n*He's a doom-weaver*\n\n*He's got the Drum of Despair*\n*In the Realm of Discord, he sits in his chair*\n\n*He has a Grimoire of Curses*\n*Ya see, he's got magic from so many sources*\n\n*Gloomweaver*\n*He's a doom-weaver*\n\n*He has a Pouch of Bones*\n*He causes screams of so many tones*\n\n*His Cursed Acolyte, some say*\n*Is a man called Ronway*\n\n*Gloomweaver*\n*He's a doom-weaver*\n\n*He has a familiar*\n*Ophidia the Deceiver*\n\n*He can do magic through a Voodoo Pin*\n*You Heroes better make sure that he doesn't win*\n\n*'Cause . . . he's . . . **GLOOMWEAVER!***",
